i.jpg}} {{IMG:Baer.jpg}}</p>\\"};\\nconst labels  = {\\"de\\":\\"Weiter\\",\\"en\\":\\"Next\\",\\"fr\\":\\"Suivant\\",\\"it\\":\\"Avanti\\"};\\nconst lang    = (window.KANJI_LANG || (((document.querySelector(\'[class*=selfHelp-locale-]\') || {}).className || \'\').match(/selfHelp-locale-([a-z]{2})/) || [])[1] || \'de\');\\nlet html      = texts[lang] || texts.de;\\n// resolve {{IMG:name}} against the study\'s file pool\\nhtml = html.replace(/\\\\{\\\\{IMG:([^}]+)\\\\}\\\\}/g, (m, name) => {\\n  const src = screen.files[name];\\n  return src ? \'<img class=\\"kanji-instr-img\\" src=\\"\' + src + \'\\">\' : \'\';\\n});\\nel.querySelector(\'#instrBody .kanji-instr-text\').innerHTML = html;\\nconst btn = el.querySelector(\'#instrNext\');\\nbtn.textContent = labels[lang] || labels.de;\\nbtn.addEventListener(\'click\', () => screen.respond(\'next\'));\\n"}],"parameters":[],"id":"c5","plugins":[]},"c6":{"title":"Instruction instr_learn 4","type":"lab.html.Screen","content":"<div class=\\"kanji-stage kanji-instr\\"><div class=\\"kanji-instr-body\\" id=\\"instrBody\\"><div class=\\"kanji-instr-content\\"><div class=\\"kanji-instr-text\\"></div></div><div class=\\"kanji-instr-actions\\"><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"kanji-next\\" id=\\"instrNext\\"></button></div></div></div>","files":[],"responses":[],"messageHandlers":[{"message":"run","code":"const screen = this;\\nconst el = this.options.el;\\nconst texts   = {\\"de\\":\\"<p><b>Sie können das Lernen der Kanjis nun üben.</b> </p> <ul> <li>Merken Sie sich gut, was die Kanjis bedeuten.</li> <li>Sie sehen die Kanjis nur für eine kurze Zeit.</li> </ul>\\",\\"en\\":\\"<b>You can now practice memorizing the kanji. </b><ul> <li>Memorize the meanings of the kanji carefully.</li> <li>You will only see the kanji for a short time.</li></ul><ul> </ul>\\",\\"fr\\":\\"<p data-end=\\\\\\"161\\\\\\" data-start=\\\\\\"96\\\\\\"><b> </b></p><p data-end=\\\\\\"161\\\\\\" data-start=\\\\\\"96\\\\\\"><b>Vous pouvez maintenant vous exercer à apprendre les kanjis.</b></p><p data-end=\\\\\\"161\\\\\\" data-start=\\\\\\"96\\\\\\"><b> </b></p> <ul> <li data-end=\\\\\\"161\\\\\\" data-start=\\\\\\"96\\\\\\">Mémorisez bien la signification des kanjis.</li> <li data-end=\\\\\\"161\\\\\\" data-start=\\\\\\"96\\\\\\">Vous ne verrez les kanjis que pendant un court moment.</li> </ul>\\",\\"it\\":\\"<p data-start=\\\\\\"47\\\\\\" data-end=\\\\\\"93\\\\\\"><b> </b></p><p data-start=\\\\\\"47\\\\\\" data-end=\\\\\\"93\\\\\\"><b>Ora può esercitarsi ad imparare i kanji.</b> </p> <ul> <li data-start=\\\\\\"47\\\\\\" data-end=\\\\\\"93\\\\\\">Si ricordi bene cosa significano i kanji.</li> <li data-start=\\\\\\"47\\\\\\" data-end=\\\\\\"93\\\\\\">Vedrà i kanji solo per un breve momento.</li> </ul>\\"};\\nconst labels  = {\\"de\\":\\"Weiter\\",\\"en\\":\\"Next\\",\\"fr\\":\\"Suivant\\",\\"it\\":\\"Avanti\\"};\\nconst lang    = (window.KANJI_LANG || (((document.querySelector(\'[class*=selfHelp-locale-]\') || {}).className || \'\').match(/selfHelp-locale-([a-z]{2})/) || [])[1] || \'de\');\\nlet html      = texts[lang] || texts.de;\\n// resolve {{IMG:name}} against the study\'s file pool\\nhtml = html.replace(/\\\\{\\\\{IMG:([^}]+)\\\\}\\\\}/g, (m, name) => {\\n  const src = screen.files[name];\\n  return src ? \'<img class=\\"kanji-instr-img\\" src=\\"\' + src + \'\\">\' : \'\';\\n});\\nel.querySelector(\'#instrBody .kanji-instr-text\').innerHTML = html;\\nconst btn = el.querySelector(\'#instrNext\');\\nbtn.textContent = labels[lang] || labels.de;\\nbtn.addEventListener(\'click\', () => screen.respond(\'next\'));\\n"}],"parameters":[],"id":"c6","plugins":[]},"c7":{"title":"Learn practice stimulus","type":"lab.html.Screen","content":"<div class=\\"kanji-stage kanji-pair\\"><img class=\\"kanji-item\\" src=\\"${ this.files[this.parameters.kanji_img] }\\"><img class=\\"kanji-item\\" src=\\"${ this.files[this.parameters.meaning_img] }\\"></div>","timeout":"5000","files":[{"localPath":"Fixationskreuz.jpg","poolPath":"embedded/9